1
00:00:00,485 --> 00:00:02,085
(Sheldon:)I'll say it looks good.

2
00:00:02,086 --> 00:00:05,186
(Sheldon:)It's in my proprietary
font, Shelvetica.

3
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:09,828
(Leonard:)I want to say
something obnoxious,

4
00:00:09,827 --> 00:00:12,827
(Leonard:)but it is easy on the eyes.

5
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:15,970
(Bernadette:)I'm a little tired, Howie.
You ready to go?

6
00:00:15,967 --> 00:00:18,397
(Howard:)Yeah, one sec. I just need
to sign this contract.

7
00:00:18,402 --> 00:00:20,172
(Bernadette:)What is it?
Well, we ran into a problem

8
00:00:20,171 --> 00:00:21,871
(Howard:)about my share of the patent,
so we're forming

9
00:00:21,873 --> 00:00:24,673
(Howard:)a partnership to split
anything we make equally.

10
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:26,305
(Penny:)Sheldon, did you draft
the contract?

11
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,480
(Sheldon:)You bet I did.

12
00:00:27,478 --> 00:00:30,748
(Penny:)Ooh. You're gonna make
out so hard tonight.

13
00:00:34,719 --> 00:00:36,049
(Bernadette:)So, you're
just gonna sign this

14
00:00:36,053 --> 00:00:37,853
(Bernadette:)without having
a lawyer look at it?

15
00:00:37,855 --> 00:00:39,385
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

16
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,720
(Sheldon:)I've been drafting contracts
since kindergarten.

17
00:00:41,726 --> 00:00:43,726
(Sheldon:)Didn't need a lawyer to get me
out of finger painting.

18
00:00:43,728 --> 00:00:46,058
(Sheldon:)Don't need one now.

19
00:00:46,063 --> 00:00:47,663
(Penny:)I know, but...
Bernie,

20
00:00:47,665 --> 00:00:49,395
(Howard:)the guys were nice enough
to find a way

21
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,130
(Howard:)to keep me from being cut out.

22
00:00:51,135 --> 00:00:53,035
(Bernadette:)Well, I should hope so.

23
00:00:53,037 --> 00:00:54,707
(Bernadette:)The whole thing was your idea.

24
00:00:54,705 --> 00:01:00,205
(Amy:)Well, to be fair, Howard's idea
was based on Sheldon's math.

